menu "Controller manager"

    config RETRO_USB_PADS
        bool "USB Xbox pads (deferred to v2)"
        default n
        help
            Start the USB host on USB-A and the xinput_host class driver for
            wired Xbox 360 / One / Series pads (plan D11). USB controllers
            are deferred to v2; v1 input is the touch screen only. The
            driver is kept building so v2 can switch it on.

endmenu
